<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Bennett Maxwell | Founder, Operator &amp; AI in Franchising</title>
<meta name="description" content="Bennett Maxwell — 2x founder with 7 & 8-figure exits, founder of Dirty Dough, CEO of Franchise KI. See Blueprint AI, the tool changing how franchises sell." />
<meta name="author" content="Bennett Maxwell" />
<!-- Open Graph -->
<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
<meta property="og:title" content="Bennett Maxwell | Founder, Operator & AI in Franchising" />
<meta property="og:description" content="2x founder, 7 & 8-figure exits. Founder of Dirty Dough, CEO of Franchise KI. See Blueprint AI." />
<meta property="og:url" content="https://bennettmaxwell.com/" />
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
<meta name="twitter:title" content="Bennett Maxwell | Founder & AI in Franchising" />
<meta name="twitter:description" content="2x founder, 7 & 8-figure exits. See Blueprint AI." />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
/* ============================================================
   PALETTE (documented — NOT inherited from the hacked WP site,
   which was a gambling-scam takeover and has no legitimate brand
   equity. Clean premium personal-brand palette instead.)
   --ink     #0B1220  near-black navy (pure-neutral safe)
   --ink-2   #11192B  section dark
   --paper   #FFFFFF  white
   --mist    #F5F6F8  light gray
   --line    #E5E8EE  borders
   --muted   #5B6475  body gray
   --accent  #2E6BFF  signal blue (Blueprint AI CTA)
   --accent-d#1E4FCC  hover
   ============================================================ */
:root{
  --ink:#0B1220; --ink-2:#11192B; --paper:#FFFFFF; --mist:#F5F6F8;
  --line:#E5E8EE; --muted:#5B6475; --accent:#2E6BFF; --accent-d:#1E4FCC;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:'Inter',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
  color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
.wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-weight:700;font-size:1rem;
  padding:15px 30px;border-radius:100px;border:2px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;
  transition:transform .15s ease,box-shadow .15s ease,background .15s ease}
.btn-primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(46,107,255,.28)}
.btn-primary:hover{background:var(--accent-d);transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 14px 36px rgba(46,107,255,.36)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--line)}
.btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--ink);transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn-light{background:#fff;color:var(--ink)}
.btn-light:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.18)}
.eyebrow{font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)}
section{padding:100px 0}
h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,4vw,2.8rem);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.2px;line-height:1.1}
.skip{position:absolute;left:-999px}.skip:focus{left:16px;top:16px;background:#fff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:8px;z-index:999}

/* NAV */
header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(255,255,255,.86);
  backdrop-filter:saturate(180%) blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:68px}
.logo{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.5px;font-size:1.15rem}
.logo span{color:var(--accent)}
.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px}
.nav-links a{font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--muted)}
.nav-links a:hover{color:var(--ink)}
.nav-cta{padding:10px 20px;font-size:.9rem}
.menu-btn{display:none;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer}

/* HERO */
.hero{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff 0%,var(--mist) 100%);padding:90px 0 80px;text-align:center}
.hero .eyebrow{margin-bottom:18px;display:inline-block}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4.2rem);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:1.04;max-width:920px;margin:0 auto}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}
.hero p.sub{font-size:clamp(1.05rem,2.2vw,1.3rem);color:var(--muted);max-width:620px;margin:22px auto 34px}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:14px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
.trustbar{display:flex;gap:32px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:54px;
  padding-top:34px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.trustbar .stat{text-align:center}
.trustbar .num{font-size:1.9rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1px}
.trustbar .lbl{font-size:.82rem;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}

/* BLUEPRINT FEATURE (PRIMARY PROMOTION) */
.blueprint{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.blueprint::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-120px;right:-120px;width:420px;height:420px;
  background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(46,107,255,.35),transparent 70%);filter:blur(20px)}
.bp-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:60px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:1}
.blueprint .eyebrow{color:#7FA8FF}
.blueprint h2{color:#fff;margin:14px 0 18px}
.blueprint p.lead{color:#C3CAD8;font-size:1.12rem;margin-bottom:28px}
.bp-list{list-style:none;display:grid;gap:16px;margin-bottom:34px}
.bp-list li{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;color:#E7EBF2;font-size:1.02rem}
.bp-list svg{flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:3px;color:var(--accent)}
.bp-card{background:linear-gradient(160deg,#16213a,#0e1830);border:1px solid #243049;
  border-radius:20px;padding:34px;box-shadow:0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.4)}
.bp-card .tag{font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7FA8FF}
.bp-card h3{font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:900;margin:10px 0 8px;letter-spacing:-.5px}
.bp-card p{color:#AEB7C7;font-size:.98rem;margin-bottom:24px}
.bp-card .btn{width:100%;justify-content:center}

/* ABOUT */
.about .eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:14px}
.about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}
.about p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem;margin-top:18px}
.about .portrait{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--ink),var(--ink-2));border-radius:24px;
  aspect-ratio:4/5;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:34px;color:#fff;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
.about .portrait::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 70% 20%,rgba(46,107,255,.3),transparent 60%)}
.about .portrait .mono{font-size:4.6rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-3px;position:relative;z-index:1;line-height:.9}
.about .portrait .role{position:relative;z-index:1;color:#C3CAD8;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px}

/* CREDS */
.creds{background:var(--mist)}
.creds .head{text-align:center;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 56px}
.creds .head p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px;font-size:1.05rem}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:22px}
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:30px;transition:transform .18s,box-shadow .18s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(11,18,32,.08)}
.card .ico{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(46,107,255,.1);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:18px}
.card h3{font-size:1.18rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.4px;margin-bottom:8px}
.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.97rem}

/* PODCAST / SPEAKING */
.speaking{text-align:center}
.speaking .head{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 18px}
.speaking p.lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem;margin-top:14px}
.topics{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin:34px 0 38px}
.topic{background:var(--mist);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:100px;padding:10px 20px;font-weight:600;font-size:.95rem}

/* FINAL CTA */
.final{background:var(--ink);color:#fff;text-align:center}
.final h2{color:#fff}
.final p{color:#C3CAD8;max-width:560px;margin:18px auto 32px;font-size:1.1rem}
.final .hero-cta{margin-top:0}

/* FOOTER */
footer{background:#070C16;color:#8B94A6;padding:48px 0;font-size:.92rem}
.foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.foot a{color:#C3CAD8;font-weight:600}
.foot a:hover{color:#fff}
.foot .social{display:flex;gap:18px}

@media(max-width:820px){
  .nav-links{display:none}
  .menu-btn{display:block}
  .nav-links.open{display:flex;position:absolute;top:68px;left:0;right:0;background:#fff;
    flex-direction:column;padding:22px 24px;gap:18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
  .bp-grid,.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}
  .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  section{padding:72px 0}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<a href="#main" class="skip">Skip to content</a>

<header>
  <div class="wrap nav">
    <a href="#" class="logo">Bennett<span>Maxwell</span></a>
    <nav class="nav-links" id="navlinks">
      <a href="#blueprint">Blueprint AI</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#work">What I Do</a>
      <a href="#speaking">Speaking</a>
      <a href="https://bennett-maxwell.github.io/fki-preview/qualify.html?src=bennettmaxwell-podcast" class="btn btn-primary nav-cta">Try Blueprint AI</a>
    </nav>
    <button class="menu-btn" id="menuBtn" aria-label="Open menu">
      <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B1220" stroke-width="2"><line x1="3" y1="6" x2="21" y2="6"/><line x1="3" y1="12" x2="21" y2="12"/><line x1="3" y1="18" x2="21" y2="18"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="main">

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Founder &middot; Operator &middot; AI in Franchising</span>
    <h1>I scale franchises and build the <em>AI</em> that sells them.</h1>
    <p class="sub">2x founder with 7 &amp; 8-figure exits. Founder of Dirty Dough, CEO of Franchise KI. Now I'm putting the franchise sales process inside AI &mdash; it's called Blueprint AI.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="https://bennett-maxwell.github.io/fki-preview/qualify.html?src=bennettmaxwell-podcast" class="btn btn-primary">See Blueprint AI
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
      <a href="#about" class="btn btn-ghost">My Story</a>
    </div>
    <div class="trustbar">
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">2x</div><div class="lbl">Exits (7 &amp; 8 fig)</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">70+</div><div class="lbl">Dirty Dough Locations</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">Forbes</div><div class="lbl">Business Council</div></div>
      <div class="stat"><div class="num">100s</div><div class="lbl">In Development</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- BLUEPRINT AI — PRIMARY PROMOTION -->
<section class="blueprint" id="blueprint">
  <div class="wrap bp-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">The reason I'm here</span>
      <h2>Blueprint AI</h2>
      <p class="lead">The hardest part of franchising isn't the cookies, the build-out, or the capital. It's the sales conversation &mdash; getting the right person to the right opportunity with real clarity. Blueprint AI puts that entire process into a system that works while you sleep.</p>
      <ul class="bp-list">
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span><strong>AI that enhances the human conversation</strong> &mdash; it doesn't replace the relationship, it makes every rep sharper.</span></li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span><strong>Qualify and educate prospects faster</strong> &mdash; from first touch to FDD to funding clarity.</span></li>
        <li><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg><span><strong>Built by an operator who's actually done it</strong> &mdash; not a software company guessing at franchising.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <a href="https://bennett-maxwell.github.io/fki-preview/qualify.html?src=bennettmaxwell-podcast" class="btn btn-primary">Explore Blueprint AI
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="bp-card">
      <div class="tag">Now Live</div>
      <h3>Put your franchise sales on AI</h3>
      <p>If you're a franchisor, brand, or operator who heard me on a podcast &mdash; this is the thing I was talking about. See how it works in a few minutes.</p>
      <a href="https://bennett-maxwell.github.io/fki-preview/qualify.html?src=bennettmaxwell-podcast" class="btn btn-light">Get Started with Blueprint AI</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap about-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">About Bennett</span>
      <h2>From cold-knocking doors to building the future of franchising.</h2>
      <p>I started by selling candy bars in school, moved into solar sales, then co-founded my way to my first exit. I bought Dirty Dough when it was being run out of an apartment in Arizona &mdash; and built it into one of the fastest-growing dessert franchises in the country, with 70+ locations open and hundreds more in development.</p>
      <p>Along the way I learned the real lever in franchising is the sales and education process. That's why I founded Franchise KI &mdash; helping people find the right franchise using knowledge and intelligence &mdash; and why I built Blueprint AI to put that process into software.</p>
      <p>I also host the <strong>Deeper Than Dough</strong> podcast, where I talk about finding joy and fulfillment in business and life through self-awareness and mindset.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="portrait" aria-hidden="true">
      <div>
        <div class="mono">BM</div>
        <div class="role">Founder &middot; CEO, Franchise KI</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WHAT I DO -->
<section class="creds" id="work">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <span class="eyebrow">What I do</span>
      <h2>Three things I'm focused on right now.</h2>
      <p>If you want to work with me, this is where to start &mdash; and Blueprint AI is the front door to all of it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cards">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ico"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Blueprint AI</h3>
        <p>AI for franchise sales and education. The tool I talk about on every podcast &mdash; built to scale the human conversation, not replace it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ico"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Franchise KI</h3>
        <p>Free guidance for entrepreneurs finding the right franchise &mdash; FDD review, owner conversations, funding, and territory analysis.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="ico"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"/><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2M12 19v4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Speaking &amp; Podcasts</h3>
        <p>I share what actually worked &mdash; scaling fast, selling smart, mindset, and applying AI to a relationship-driven business.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SPEAKING -->
<section class="speaking" id="speaking">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head">
      <span class="eyebrow">For podcast hosts &amp; event organizers</span>
      <h2>Have me on your show.</h2>
      <p class="lead">I bring real numbers, hard-won lessons, and a clear point of view on where AI is taking franchising. Topics I go deep on:</p>
    </div>
    <div class="topics">
      <span class="topic">Scaling a franchise fast</span>
      <span class="topic">7 &amp; 8-figure exits</span>
      <span class="topic">AI in sales</span>
      <span class="topic">Buying a business</span>
      <span class="topic">Mindset &amp; fulfillment</span>
      <span class="topic">Freedom through ownership</span>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="https://bennett-maxwell.github.io/fki-preview/qualify.html?src=bennettmaxwell-podcast" class="btn btn-primary">See Blueprint AI First</a>
      <a href="mailto:bennett@franchiseki.com" class="btn btn-ghost">Email Me</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FINAL CTA -->
<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Heard me on a podcast?</h2>
    <p>The thing I was talking about is Blueprint AI. Take two minutes and see it for yourself.</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="https://bennett-maxwell.github.io/fki-preview/qualify.html?src=bennettmaxwell-podcast" class="btn btn-primary">Try Blueprint AI
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap foot">
    <div>&copy; <span id="yr"></span> Bennett Maxwell. All rights reserved.</div>
    <div class="social">
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bennett-maxwell-703717126/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="https://www.instagram.com/bennettmaxwell35/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
      <a href="mailto:bennett@franchiseki.com">Email</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

